flowchart TB
  K[Cache key: model+prompt+params] --> L{Lookup}
  L -->|hit| Save[Return cached; cost 0; log savings]
  L -->|miss| Est[Estimate tokens and USD]
  Est --> B{Within budget?}
  B -->|no| Err[BudgetExceeded]
  B -->|yes| M[Call model]
  M --> W[Write cache]
  M --> Led[Append UsageEvent]
